### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  CareSync Backend — Tests HTTP complets
###  Base URL : http://localhost:8081/api/v1
###  Auth     : Keycloak http://localhost:8080/realms/caresync
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ── 1. AUTHENTIFICATION ────────────────────────────────────────

### Login — obtenir le token JWT Keycloak
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/caresync/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=caresync-backend&client_secret=caresync-client-secret-dev&username=dr.dupont&password=Password1!&scope=openid

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token);
        console.log("✅ Token JWT obtenu");
    } else {
        console.log("❌ Auth failed", response.status);
    }
%}

### ── 2. DISPOSITIFS IoT ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Enregistrer un glucomètre
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/devices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "deviceType": "GLUCOMETER",
  "manufacturer": "Accu-Check",
  "model": "Guide Plus",
  "serialNumber": "GLU-001",
  "protocol": "MQTT",
  "firmwareVersion": "3.2.1"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("device_id", response.body.id);
        console.log("✅ Dispositif enregistré:", response.body.id);
    }
%}

###

### Lister les dispositifs d'un patient
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/devices/patient/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 3. OBSERVATIONS ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Saisie manuelle d'une observation (médecin)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/observations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "deviceType": "GLUCOMETER",
  "value": 1.15,
  "unit": "g/L"
}

###

### Saisie observation hors seuil → déclenche une alerte
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/observations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "deviceType": "GLUCOMETER",
  "value": 3.8,
  "unit": "g/L",
  "note": "Post-repas, patient signale symptômes"
}

###

### Saisie observation physiologiquement impossible → 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/observations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "deviceType": "GLUCOMETER",
  "value": 42.0,
  "unit": "g/L"
}

###

### Historique des observations d'un patient
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/patients/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/observations?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dernière mesure glycémie
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/iot/patients/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/observations/latest/GLUCOMETER
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 4. SEUILS D'ALERTE ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Configurer les seuils glycémie pour Jean Martin
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/patients/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/thresholds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "deviceType": "GLUCOMETER",
  "criticalLow": 0.6,
  "warningLow": 0.8,
  "warningHigh": 2.5,
  "criticalHigh": 4.0
}

###

### Configurer seuils poids ICFe (Sophie Durand)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/patients/a0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/thresholds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "deviceType": "SCALE",
  "deltaThreshold48h": 2.0
}

###

### Lister les seuils d'un patient
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/patients/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/thresholds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 5. ALERTES CLINIQUES ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Toutes les alertes actives
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Alertes d'un patient spécifique
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/patient/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200 && response.body.content?.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("alert_id", response.body.content[0].id);
        console.log("Alert ID:", response.body.content[0].id);
    }
%}

###

### Détail d'une alerte
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/{{alert_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Acquitter une alerte (médecin ou infirmier)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/{{alert_id}}/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "comment": "Patient contacté — Actonel ajusté, contrôle J+1 programmé"
}

###

### Résoudre une alerte (médecin uniquement)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/{{alert_id}}/resolve?note=Valeurs+revenues+à+la+normale
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 6. SIMULATEUR IoT (profil demo/dev uniquement) ──────────────

### Déclencher scénario hypoglycémie
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/sim/scenario/HYPOGLYCEMIE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Déclencher chute SpO2
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/sim/scenario/CHUTE_SPO2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Déclencher rétention hydrique ICFe
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/sim/scenario/RETENTION_HYDRIQUE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Retour normal
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/sim/scenario/NORMAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Scénario actif
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/sim/scenario
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 7. ANALYTICS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard opérationnel temps réel
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/analytics/dashboard/operational
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dashboard tactique 7 jours — Jean Martin
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/analytics/dashboard/tactical/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dashboard stratégique 30 jours
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/analytics/dashboard/strategic
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Série temporelle glycémie — 24h
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/analytics/timeseries/a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/GLUCOMETER?lastHours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Série temporelle SpO2 — 48h
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/analytics/timeseries/a0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/PULSE_OXIMETER?lastHours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── 8. CAS D'ERREUR ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Alerte inexistante → 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Sans token → 401
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts

###

### Infirmier tente de résoudre → 403
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/alerts/{{alert_id}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token_infirmier}}
